---
---
<section id="testimonials">
  <div class="testi-head reveal">
    <div class="section-label">What They Say</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Voices That <span>Matter</span></h2>
  </div>

  <div class="testimonials-grid">
    <div class="testi-card reveal stagger-1">
      <div class="testi-quote-mark">"</div>
      <p class="testi-text">Quiz Malie transformed how our pupils approach learning. The competition gave them a stage, and their confidence has soared ever since. They've never been the same.</p>
      <div class="testi-author">
        <div class="testi-avatar">SK</div>
        <div>
          <span class="testi-name">Sarah K.</span>
          <span class="testi-role">Head Teacher, Namugongo Girls School</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testi-card reveal stagger-2">
      <div class="testi-quote-mark">"</div>
      <p class="testi-text">As a partner, the return on impact is unmatched. Quiz Malie reaches families, educators, and learners in a way no other media platform in Uganda does. Proud to be part of it.</p>
      <div class="testi-author">
        <div class="testi-avatar">JM</div>
        <div>
          <span class="testi-name">James M.</span>
          <span class="testi-role">Marketing Director, Partner Brand</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="testi-card reveal stagger-3">
      <div class="testi-quote-mark">"</div>
      <p class="testi-text">Watching my daughter compete on the national stage was the proudest moment of my life as a parent. Quiz Malie isn't just a show — it's a movement for Uganda's future.</p>
      <div class="testi-author">
        <div class="testi-avatar">PN</div>
        <div>
          <span class="testi-name">Patricia N.</span>
          <span class="testi-role">Parent, Kampala</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  #testimonials {
    padding: 120px 8% 100px;
    background: var(--color-navy);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  #testimonials::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px; right: -200px;
    width: 600px; height: 600px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(40,184,112,0.08) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Light heading on navy */
  .testi-head .section-label { color: #6ae8b0; }
  .testi-head .section-title { color: #fff; }
  .testi-head .section-title span { color: var(--color-green-light); }

  .testimonials-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .testi-card {
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    position: relative;
    transition: background 0.3s, border-color 0.3s, transform 0.3s;
  }
  .testi-card:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-color: rgba(40,184,112,0.3); transform: translateY(-6px); }
  .testi-quote-mark {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 5rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--color-green-light);
    line-height: 0.8;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }
  .testi-text {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-weight: 300;
    font-style: italic;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .testi-author {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding-top: 1.2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .testi-avatar {
    width: 42px; height: 42px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--color-green-light), var(--color-orange));
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: #fff;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .testi-name { font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 600; color: #fff; display: block; }
  .testi-role { font-size: 0.78rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); display: block; margin-top: 2px; }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .testimonials-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
</style>
